@startuml UC_SURAT
!theme plain
skinparam defaultFontSize 12
skinparam TitleFontSize 14
title Use Case Diagram — Modul Surat Menyurat
left to right direction

actor "Admin / Sekretaris" as Admin
actor "Asisten"            as Asisten
actor "Dosen"              as Dosen
actor "Kadep"              as Kadep

' Generalisasi: Kadep mewarisi akses Dosen
' (lihat detail surat + lihat arsip surat resmi)
Dosen <|-- Kadep

rectangle "Modul Surat Menyurat" {
  rectangle "Surat Pribadi" {
    usecase "UC01\nKirim Surat Pribadi"    as UC01
    usecase "UC02\nLihat Surat Masuk"      as UC02
    usecase "UC03\nLihat Surat Keluar"     as UC03
    usecase "UC04\nLihat Detail & Unduh"   as UC04
  }
  rectangle "Surat Resmi Lab" {
    usecase "UC05\nKirim Surat Resmi"      as UC05
    usecase "UC06\nLihat Arsip Surat Resmi" as UC06
  }
}

Admin   --> UC01
Admin   --> UC02
Admin   --> UC03
Admin   --> UC04
Admin   --> UC05
Admin   --> UC06

Asisten --> UC01
Asisten --> UC02
Asisten --> UC03
Asisten --> UC04

' Dosen – lihat detail & unduh surat + lihat arsip surat resmi (view-only)
Dosen   --> UC04
Dosen   --> UC06

' Kadep – mewarisi akses Dosen (UC04, UC06) via generalisasi

note right of UC05
  Permission: surat.create_resmi
  Hanya Admin & Asisten ber-jabatan Sekretaris
end note

note right of UC06
  Permission: surat.view_all
  Menampilkan seluruh arsip resmi
  milik lab yang dimiliki user
end note
@enduml
